	(text "Relays: TBD62083AFNG, direct from GPIO. 100k pulldown holds every relay off through reset." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.00 20.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "e060b020-e967-434e-b5e5-a6283fd25fc8"))
	(text "COMMON = permanent B+ (EEC-V 55, 729 RD/WH, CJB 5 A): every coil feed is at or below it, so no channel" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.00 24.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "cb4cde1b-3fe6-4bcf-a005-5db28a2daad1"))
	(text "back-feeds. [CONFIRM] sharing pin 55 with the battery-sense divider: clamp current is only the coil decay." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.00 28.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f2e7ddd4-6b85-4778-9876-1e0eacda8006"))
	(text "PTC in series: the array has no current limit, so a shorted coil is stopped by F60x. Coil currents [CONFIRM] on the truck." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.00 32.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f7b2fc8d-85d5-42b2-967c-ababe9ee9809"))
